{"4651120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Farming Incremental But With Guns", "steam_appid": 4651120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming Incremental But With Guns is an active first-person incremental game in which you plant gigantic crops and shoot them down with your trusty gun. Earn money, purchase upgrades, and cultivate your farm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">WEAPONIZED AGRICULTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore diverse biomes like the freezing winter lands, green meadows, and harsh deserts, locking and loading your trusty gun to blast down absolutely massive, towering crops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651120/extras/fc996c295cbab75b6c399815952d7dbc.poster.avif?t=1786483334\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651120/extras/fc996c295cbab75b6c399815952d7dbc.webm?t=1786483334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651120/extras/fc996c295cbab75b6c399815952d7dbc.mp4?t=1786483334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">AN AVALANCHE OF COINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the coins physically overflow! Use all that sweet wealth to purchase game-breaking upgrades for your arsenal; expand AND GROW your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651120/extras/665a2717792f385e3885ab62d91a5916.poster.avif?t=1786483334\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651120/extras/665a2717792f385e3885ab62d91a5916.webm?t=1786483334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651120/extras/665a2717792f385e3885ab62d91a5916.mp4?t=1786483334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ENCHANT, EVOLVE, ECLIPSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover crop enchants. Push your crops to gigantic proportions and never stop growing them until they block out the sun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651120/extras/2a913fa686f689ce7bfd5a74da0813b6.poster.avif?t=1786483334\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651120/extras/2a913fa686f689ce7bfd5a74da0813b6.webm?t=1786483334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651120/extras/2a913fa686f689ce7bfd5a74da0813b6.mp4?t=1786483334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming Incremental But With Guns is an active first-person incremental game in which you plant gigantic crops and shoot them down with your trusty gun. Earn money, purchase upgrades, and cultivate your farm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">WEAPONIZED AGRICULTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore diverse biomes like the freezing winter lands, green meadows, and harsh deserts, locking and loading your trusty gun to blast down absolutely massive, towering crops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://share